<title>UK: Yorkshire Food slips to year loss.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire Food slips to year loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		55.3 loss	  vs 10.47 profit</p>
<p> Final div(pence)	 0		    vs 3.00</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 0.88		 vs 3.88</p>
<p> Pretax		     26.33 loss	 vs 6.91 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   159,849	    vs 174,360</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British food group is Yorkshire Food Group Plc. The company said the outlook for the second half of the current year led it to be optimistic for future trading.</p>
